## Payment security

- Create payment sessions or orders on the server.
- Calculate prices using trusted database records.
- Never trust client-submitted prices.
- Verify provider signatures and payment status on the server.
- Verify signed webhooks.
- Handle duplicate events idempotently.
- Prevent duplicate order fulfillment.
- Handle failed, cancelled, pending, and refunded transactions.
- Record provider references and transaction state.
- Release licenses and protected downloads only after verified payment and entitlement checks.

Never store raw card details.

Do not simulate a successful production payment or represent a test transaction as real money received.

