## Important data relationships

One application can have many builds.

Each build belongs to a specific application and describes a supported platform, architecture, version, installer type, and release status.

Each application can have multiple license plans.

An order contains purchased license plans or application entitlements.

A verified purchase creates the appropriate entitlement, not an unrestricted public download link.

License keys must be stored securely and never exposed in logs or analytics.

Use transactions when creating orders, recording payments, allocating license inventory, and fulfilling entitlements.

Do not store actual installers as database blobs. Store metadata and authorized object-storage references.

